<title>UK: SALOMON SETS 100 MLN STG OCT 2002 FRN.</title>
<headline>SALOMON SETS 100 MLN STG OCT 2002 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers International Inc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SALOMON INC</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 OCT.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     37.5 BP   PAY DATE    21.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA1	ISS PRICE  99.68     FULL FEES   30 BP</p>
